    description: "Hoi An's Ancient Town is Vietnam's best-preserved historic trading port — a 1km-wide pedestrian zone of ochre-yellow walls, wooden merchant houses, and covered bridges that transforms into a lantern-lit magical scene every evening. Tailors, food stalls, and river boat rides complete the experience.",
