    description: 'Rishikesh is where the Beatles studied transcendental meditation, where India\'s most serious yoga schools teach, and where the Ganges is still cold, clear, and swift before the plains slow it. A town of saffron-robed sadhus, backpacker cafes, and genuine spiritual seekers.',
